{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00430","headline":"郊庙歌辞 明堂乐章 肃和 · 褚亮","name":"郊庙歌辞 明堂乐章 肃和","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"象天御宇，乘时布政。\n严配申虔，宗禋展敬。\n罇罍盈列，树羽交映。\n玉币通诚，祚隆皇圣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"褚亮","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00430.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00430","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}